# NOTE: do NOT add a bare "package.json" line here — this repo relies on several NESTED
# package.json files (src/config/package.json, src/migrations/package.json,
# src/migrations/tenant_migrations/package.json, src/seeders/admin/package.json) that each
# just declare {"type": "commonjs"} or {"type": "module"} to override the root package.json's
# module type for that folder. A pattern like "package.json" is NOT anchored to the repo root
# — it would match and exclude ALL of those too, silently breaking CJS/ESM interop at runtime.
